  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"U95vF\" id=\"U95vF\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ba34fea\" id=\"u1ba34fea\">默认值参数</span></h2><ul list=\"u75f8a5ce\"><li fid=\"u5fb70b31\" data-lake-id=\"uf5bef765\" id=\"uf5bef765\"><span data-lake-id=\"u93d79b73\" id=\"u93d79b73\">形参设定默认值 称为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1805048d\" id=\"u1805048d\">默认参数。</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u80091585\" id=\"u80091585\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34)\">调用函数时，可以使用比定义时更少的参数。</span></li><li fid=\"u5fb70b31\" data-lake-id=\"ua954f7c0\" id=\"ua954f7c0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2e7784f\" id=\"ub2e7784f\">调用函数时，如果没有传入默认参数对应的实参，则实参使用默认值</span></li><li fid=\"u5fb70b31\" data-lake-id=\"u7b13d17b\" id=\"u7b13d17b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud21d0b74\" id=\"ud21d0b74\">默认参数在调用的时候可以不传递，也可以传递</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20say_hello(name%3D'%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E')%3A%23%20%E5%BD%A2%E5%8F%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E7%BB%99%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E6%89%93%E6%8B%9B%E5%91%BC%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20name%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20'%2C%20name)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%2C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E5%80%BC%5Cnsay_hello()%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%97%B6%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%5Cnsay_hello('%E9%AB%98%E5%9C%86%E5%9C%86')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BvISE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua09f5c3c\" id=\"ua09f5c3c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc169840\" id=\"ucc169840\">注意：</span></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ua8c8f6d4\" id=\"ua8c8f6d4\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-warning\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0930e455\" id=\"u0930e455\"><span data-lake-id=\"u902b442e\" id=\"u902b442e\">默认参数一定要在参数的最后</span></p></blockquote><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20say_hello(score%2C%20name%3D'%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E')%3A%23%20%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E9%9D%A2%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E7%BB%99%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E6%89%93%E6%8B%9B%E5%91%BC%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20name%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20%25s'%25(name))%5Cn%5Cnsay_hello(60%2C%20'%E9%AB%98%E5%9C%86%E5%9C%86')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22axY8L%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"LsTek\" id=\"LsTek\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u398e097a\" id=\"u398e097a\">关键字参数</span></h2><ul list=\"u0999d4e4\"><li fid=\"u812ecf75\" data-lake-id=\"u1d5183a7\" id=\"u1d5183a7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2082419c\" id=\"u2082419c\">调用函数时，实参可以指定对应的形参，称为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8c7ca938\" id=\"u8c7ca938\">关键字参数</span></strong></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20say_hello(name%2C%20age%2C%20score)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%3A%25s%2C%E5%B9%B4%E7%BA%AA%3A%25d%2C%E5%88%86%E6%95%B0%3A%25f'%25(name%2Cage%2Cscore))%5Cn%5Cnsay_hello(name%3D'%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E'%2Cage%3D60%2Cscore%3D70.5)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E7Mqb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u60e5bb52\"><li fid=\"u60279b7d\" data-lake-id=\"uc6b8a85e\" id=\"uc6b8a85e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u30d1d070\" id=\"u30d1d070\">使用关键字参数调用可以</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue209d457\" id=\"ue209d457\">改变传递参数的顺序</span></strong></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%E7%9A%84%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%5Cnsay_hello(score%3D70%2Cage%3D30%2Cname%3D'%E9%AB%98%E5%9C%86%E5%9C%86')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S7ZLX%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"JJwrZ\" id=\"JJwrZ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8f0723a\" id=\"ub8f0723a\">练习-根据需要创建用户</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ue17b1bfb\" id=\"ue17b1bfb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u376cbef0\" id=\"u376cbef0\">根据需要创建对象是很常见的需求，在一个函数中，我们可以保留一些默认配置，然后根据需要进行修改。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9659de5b\" id=\"u9659de5b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u24aa6ed1\" id=\"u24aa6ed1\">例如，我们有一个创建用户的函数</span><code data-lake-id=\"u4f89fc0c\" id=\"u4f89fc0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u570c280b\" id=\"u570c280b\">create_user</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf5fb0472\" id=\"uf5fb0472\">，参数如下</span></p><ul list=\"u7f69d4cf\"><li fid=\"ue611401c\" data-lake-id=\"ud8282141\" id=\"ud8282141\"><code data-lake-id=\"u155df791\" id=\"u155df791\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5502b159\" id=\"u5502b159\">username</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub7dff62d\" id=\"ub7dff62d\"> （用户名）必填</span></li><li fid=\"ue611401c\" data-lake-id=\"u4b79fa3c\" id=\"u4b79fa3c\"><code data-lake-id=\"u507f77c6\" id=\"u507f77c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua684934e\" id=\"ua684934e\">password</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf7ea8e30\" id=\"uf7ea8e30\"> （密码）\t必填</span></li><li fid=\"ue611401c\" data-lake-id=\"u1f2ffcdd\" id=\"u1f2ffcdd\"><code data-lake-id=\"u6dcbc7d2\" id=\"u6dcbc7d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u199a6d47\" id=\"u199a6d47\">is_admin</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub0207c12\" id=\"ub0207c12\"> （是否是管理员）可选，默认为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8b1e579e\" id=\"u8b1e579e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u979620b4\" id=\"u979620b4\">False</span></code></li><li fid=\"ue611401c\" data-lake-id=\"ud6fbc295\" id=\"ud6fbc295\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc6bdbe77\" id=\"uc6bdbe77\"><span data-lake-id=\"u326045a6\" id=\"u326045a6\">is_active</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u582485f7\" id=\"u582485f7\"> （是否已激活）可选，默认为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5a4e12f5\" id=\"u5a4e12f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucbd341ce\" id=\"ucbd341ce\">True</span></code></li><li fid=\"ue611401c\" data-lake-id=\"u67b07564\" id=\"u67b07564\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud6035745\" id=\"ud6035745\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89e1ac87\" id=\"u89e1ac87\">is_verified</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufeea936f\" id=\"ufeea936f\"> （是否已验证）可选，默认为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8dd940e7\" id=\"u8dd940e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u128230a0\" id=\"u128230a0\">False</span></code></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"EWqpL\" id=\"EWqpL\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3a19b9d\" id=\"ub3a19b9d\">需求</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u78fc29a8\" id=\"u78fc29a8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u56d66801\" id=\"u56d66801\">声明一个函数，实现根据需求</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaa5c9f93\" id=\"uaa5c9f93\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua33d1982\" id=\"ua33d1982\">create_user</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2f1ab4e7\" id=\"u2f1ab4e7\">创建用户，打印用户的创建用户用到的参数。使其支持如下方式的代码调用：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22create_user(%5C%22john%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22password%5C%22)%5Cncreate_user(%5C%22jane%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22password123%5C%22%2C%20is_admin%3DTrue)%5Cncreate_user(%5C%22alice%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22pass123%5C%22%2C%20is_active%3DFalse%2C%20is_verified%3DTrue)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rgq6m%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"OkXVk\" id=\"OkXVk\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62d55a4f\" id=\"u62d55a4f\">代码</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%8F%91%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20create_user(username%2C%20password%2C%20is_admin%3DFalse%2C%20is_active%3DTrue%2C%20is_verified%3DFalse)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%9A%84%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Creating%20user...%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Username%3A%5C%22%2C%20username)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Password%3A%5C%22%2C%20password)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Is%20Admin%3A%5C%22%2C%20is_admin)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Is%20Active%3A%5C%22%2C%20is_active)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Is%20Verified%3A%5C%22%2C%20is_verified)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22User%20created%20successfully.%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%5Cncreate_user(%5C%22john%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22password%5C%22)%5Cncreate_user(%5C%22jane%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22password123%5C%22%2C%20is_admin%3DTrue)%5Cncreate_user(%5C%22alice%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22pass123%5C%22%2C%20is_active%3DFalse%2C%20is_verified%3DTrue)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Atrue%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%8F%91%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SolcS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub5d98f96\" id=\"ub5d98f96\"><br></p>",
